                    <div class="preview-info-sm-card-text-block">
                      <h3 class="heading-style-5 text-align-center text-color-primary-900">15+ Pages</h3>
                      <p class="text-size-regular text-align-center text-color-gray-600">A flexible library of consulting-focused Webflow sections designed to structure messaging, services, offers, and proof points without losing strategic intent.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div to-top-6="" class="preview-info-sm-card-block">
                    <div class="preview-info-sm-card-image-block"><img src="/images/preview-info-sm-card-image-2.webp" loading="lazy" alt="Website section showing executive coaching, leadership profiles, and business growth services." class="preview-info-sm-card-image"></div>
                    <div class="preview-info-sm-card-text-block">
                      <h3 class="heading-style-5 text-align-center text-color-primary-900">25+ Styles &amp; components</h3>
                      <p class="text-size-regular text-align-center text-color-gray-600">Send us an email to support@Inks.studio.com with your purchase receipt, and we will send you the editable Figma file for the LeadCraft template. </p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div to-top-2="" class="preview-info-bottom-block">
                  <div class="preview-info-lg-card-block">
                    <div class="preview-info-lg-card-content-block">
